cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or data, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: >-
  MCP migrations: Model Context Protocol projects across a breaking protocol
  revision
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and data for a study of MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers on
  GitHub responding to the 2026-07-28 protocol revision and the v2 SDKs:
  migration episodes mined from 32,939 repositories, LLM-assisted and
  human-verified labeling samples, coded developer text, and scripts that
  regenerate every statistic and figure.
authors:
  - name: Anonymous authors
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - Model Context Protocol
  - API migration
  - breaking changes
  - software evolution
  - mining software repositories
  - technical lag
